  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MONSTAT Strengthening the National Statistical System of Mongolia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to improve efficiency and effectiveness of the national statistical system of Mongolia to enable it to provide relevant, timely and reliable data for evidence-based policy making in support of Government&#xe2;&#x80;&#x99;s MDG-based National Development Strategy (NDS).</narrative>
  </description>
